 "must": [
  "beta_tlt_spy_1y",
  "beta_tlt_spy_3m"
 ],
 "note": "an early level, not a feeling: a hedge that works has a NEGATIVE beta to equities; TLT's beta to SPY is the number to watch, shown on the 1y window and the 3m window (the 3m one reacts first) with the shift between them; HYG the same. The written trigger is 'TLT's 3m beta to SPY above zero' — it already is (+0.17 on 1y), which is why t1 showed no offset; the run's netted rates beta (0.009) says the book is near-flat to rates overall."
}
